  "goodToKnow": "Der Millionär (die Millionärin) is a millionaire. Wer wird Millionär?, hosted by Günther Jauch since 1999, is one of Germany's most popular TV shows. Careful with big numbers: German eine Milliarde is an English billion, and eine Billion is a trillion, so a billionaire is der Milliardär. Germany has about 1.6 million millionaires in US dollars, according to bank wealth reports. Plural: die Millionäre."
